        <li>World Battery Hub data section — <a href="https://data.worldbatteryhub.com/battery-groups/group31/">Group 31 reference page</a> (dimensions, capacity, CCA basis, terminal).</li>
        <li>Battery Council International (BCI) — battery group size definitions.</li>
        <li>SAE J537 — cranking-ampere test method used for North American CCA ratings.</li>
        <li>Manufacturer datasheets (flooded and AGM Group 31, starting / deep-cycle / dual-purpose variants) — dimensional and rating cross-checks.</li>
      </ul>

